binbun's terminal emulator: libghostty-vt
=========================================

The GUI's terminals run through libghostty-vt, Ghostty's terminal
emulation library, linked into the app statically (from the ghostty-vt
crate, whose own licence is in app.md with the other crates'). It links in
the third-party projects below, as its deps/libghostty-vt-third-party.json
lists them. Where a project offers a choice of licences, the one it is used
under here is named. Each licence text is in third_party/libghostty/; the
app's downloads carry this file and those texts in licenses/.


